@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. ID bai tap khong hop le - 404 rong do framework
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc

### 6. Nop vao bai tap da dong - 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 7. Du lieu nop khong hop le - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Bai tap cha khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 9. Nop bai hop le - 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 10. Doc lai luot nop vua tao - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 11. Nop trung cung bai tap va sinh vien - 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "sv002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api-lan-2"
}

### 12. Rut luot nop - 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 13. Rut lai luot nop da xoa - 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 14. Nop lai sau khi rut - 201 Created voi ID moi
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 15. Thieu Content-Type - 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv003/rest-api"
}

### 16. Sai phuong thuc - 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
